Four-column array read by rows: T(n,k) = the coefficient of x^k in the expanded polynomial x^3 + (x+1)^3 + ... + (x+n-1)^3, for 0 <= k <= 3.

The 64 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
